{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS9S6KJncT3GdMLgUMiu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` are wired into the registration and offers screens through `Analytics.capture`. `flutter analyze` reports no issues. I did not run the app or check the events in PostHog, and nothing is committed.\n\n**What changed**\n- **Registration screen:**\n  - `registration_email_started` and `registration_phone_started` fire once per screen visit, on the first edit, using a flag per field.\n  - `loan_amount_changed` fires from the slider's `onChangeEnd`, once per drag, with `amount`.\n  - `terms_accepted` fires only when the box is ticked.\n  - `registration_continue_tapped` fires before navigating, with `amount` and `terms`.\n- **Offers screen:** `offers_scrolled` fires from `ScrollEndNotification`, once per scroll, with `offset`.\n- Emails and phone numbers are never sent.\n- `ANSWER.md` has the full write-up.\n\n**Colleague note:** I applied three parts: the once-per-visit flag for the text fields, `onChangeEnd` for the slider, and `ScrollEndNotification` for scrolls. The focus-node and final-value parts don't apply, because the spec has no event that needs them.\n\n**Decisions to review**\n- `loan_amount_changed` also fires on a plain tap on the slider.\n- `registration_continue_tapped` fires only when the button is enabled, so `terms` is always `true` in it.\n- `offers_scrolled` `offset` is the absolute scroll position at the end of the scroll, not the distance of that gesture. The spec says \"how far they scrolled\", so this is my reading.\n\n**Not verified:** the PostHog key in `lib/analytics.dart` is still the `phc_REPLACE_ME_IN_CI` placeholder, so no events were sent or checked. `flutter pub get` also changed `analysis_options.yaml` and created `.dart_tool/` and `pubspec.lock`. I reverted the config and removed the generated files, so the diff contains only the two screens and `ANSWER.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":182,"cache_read_input_tokens":41932,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":182},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc749266-acaa-4d52-9ee5-7158afe49acc","uuid":"d76cce15-9098-4b71-99dd-3eb3ed5fa19d","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:55:22.395Z","request_id":"req_011CgS9S65f739nVD1ntvqJf"}
